// AWS EC2 Instance User Data Modified  [tier: alert]  ATT&CK: T1059.009, T1648
// Detects modification of an EC2 instance's user data (ModifyInstanceAttribute with userData). User data runs as root on next boot - a…
// False positives: Legitimate re-configuration of instance bootstrap (rare on running instances).
// Source: rules/execution/ec2-modify-instance-attribute-userdata.yml — generated by scripts/build_dist.py; adjust field names to your CloudTrail schema.
eventName =~ "ModifyInstanceAttribute" and eventSource =~ "ec2.amazonaws.com" and isnotempty('requestParameters.userData')
